url: 'https://ce-rise-models.codeberg.page/product-system/'
abstract: >-
  A reusable, source-agnostic data model for defining life cycle assessment product
  systems. It represents calculation-specific assemblies through versioned references
  to life cycle inventory datasets and selected activities, together with reference-flow
  specifications, scope, provenance, and optional utility records.
